  32+ 0000              ; Project126 resident execution contract, revision 0.3:
  33+ 0000              ; WIN0/page 00 is fixed resident code and data.
  34+ 0000              ; WIN1/page 03 owns the operational stack and fixed runtime data.
  35+ 0000              ; WIN2 is the 8000-BFFF overlay aperture, selected through MPAG port 00h.
  36+ 0000              ; MPAG selectors encode ROR8(physical_page), i.e. one RRCA before OUT.
  37+ 0000              ; Pinned overlays: X86IO page04/selector02, X86ALU page05/selector82, X86DEV page06/selector03, X86EXEC page07/selector83.
  38+ 0000              ; WIN3 (C000-FFFF) remains exclusively the banked guest physical-memory
  39+ 0000              ; aperture selected through MPAGEX port 10h. Resident code and stack must
  40+ 0000              ; never execute from or be stored in WIN3.
  41+ 0000              ; X86VGA is dynamic overlay ID05/page08; X86VID is ID06/page09 and converts
  42+ 0000              ; VGA text state into ATM-native frames. VGA VRAM remains in pages30h..3Fh.
  43+ 0000              P126_NGS_OVERLAY_WINDOW_INDEX     EQU 2
  44+ 0000              P126_NGS_OVERLAY_WINDOW_BASE      EQU #8000
  45+ 0000              P126_NGS_OVERLAY_WINDOW_PORT      EQU #00
